WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.849
Kip opened the bottle.

2
00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:12.555
"It's a note!" said Kip.

3
00:00:12.556 --> 00:00:17.481
"I wonder who wrote it."

4
00:00:17.482 --> 00:00:19.313
Kip read the note.

5
00:00:19.314 --> 00:00:23.130
It said: Hello. How are you?

6
00:00:23.131 --> 00:00:29.668
Please write back to me.

7
00:00:29.669 --> 00:00:32.688
"Cool!" said Kip.

8
00:00:32.689 --> 00:00:39.909
"I will write back."

9
00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:42.864
Kip got a pencil and paper.

10
00:00:42.865 --> 00:00:48.020
He wrote a note.

11
00:00:48.021 --> 00:00:53.336
He put the note in the bottle.

12
00:00:53.337 --> 00:01:00.960
Later Bird went to the pond.

13
00:01:00.961 --> 00:01:09.624
She found the bottle.

14
00:01:09.625 --> 00:01:13.357
"Someone wrote back to me!" cried Bird.

15
00:01:13.358 --> 00:01:15.919
The new note said: Hello.

16
00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:17.594
I am fine.

17
00:01:17.595 --> 00:01:19.785
I am writing back to you.

18
00:01:19.786 --> 00:01:25.817
"This is so much fun!" said Bird.

19
00:01:25.818 --> 00:01:36.394
Bird wrote a new note.

20
00:01:36.395 --> 00:01:39.283
Kip read Bird's new note the next day.

21
00:01:39.284 --> 00:01:42.391
The note said: I live in the park.

22
00:01:42.392 --> 00:01:44.870
Do you live in the park too?

23
00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:48.426
"Wow!" thought Kip.

24
00:01:48.427 --> 00:01:51.836
"I do live in the park!"

